      "title": "GNSS: add handoff for GAL I/NAV nominal page data words",
      "message": "GNSS: add handoff for GAL I/NAV nominal page data words\n\nGalileo I/NAV nominal pages include data words for ephemeris, almanac,\netc. Add a handoff for these data words and implement the dissector for\nWord Type 0 (Spare Word).\n",
